      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Percutaneous revascularization has been used for the treatment of post-coronary bypass graft ischemia. This report illustrates the use of emergency left main coronary artery stenting in protected left main on the first post-operative day for management of perioperative coronary artery bypass graft surgery ischemia."},
